rl":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"I really like the core idea, but I'm not sure why we're opting for a separate header/namespace over methods within `Span` itself. Everything so far uses `Span` as the first argument, and based off the name I imagine that'll be the case for the overwhelming majority of functions, so separating them feels like unnecessary bloat. Even if certain functions don't need to be scoped under `Span`, the convention is generally to have accompanying classes/functions within the same file (`Variant` being the only real exception thanks to its insane size), so that code should all be in `span.h` regardless.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103932#pullrequestreview-2688004332","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103932","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-15T16:33:46Z"},{"id":2688155185,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gOf4x","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"Looks great!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103932#pullrequestreview-2688155185","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103932","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-15T18:07:25Z"},{"id":2688485636,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gPwkE","state":"COMME